  "description": "Yu Byul, a man who fancies men, lives his life carefully concealing his orientation due to a school trauma. But one day, he bumps into Seo-rim, who is utterly his type, at his regular café. Unable to hide his feelings, Yu Byul flees the scene. Just when he thought that would be the end of their connection, he happens to see Seo-rim having sex with another man in an alleyway...!\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/Just_common_story), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11772254), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066601)",
